  "result": "Perfect! All 35 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Adds a new line to a draft invoice or increases qty if the SKU already exists. Validates qty and SKU like `createInvoice`. Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if the invoice isn't draft.\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Removes a line from a draft invoice. Returns:\n- `ok(newInvoice)` on success\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- `NO_LINES` if removing it would leave the invoice empty\n- `NOT_DRAFT` if the invoice isn't draft\n\n**Tests** \u2014 11 new tests covering:\n- Adding new lines\n- Updating existing SKUs\n- Validation of qty and SKU\n- Non-draft invoice rejection\n- Input immutability\n- Removing lines\n- Error cases (not found, would leave empty, not draft)\n\nAll functions never mutate their input and return new objects.",
